    "source": "---\ntier: on-path\npaths: [\"api/**\"]\ndescription: How a handler in `api/` is written.\n---\n\n# Handlers\n\nValidate the request at the boundary, and return the error the caller can act on.\n\nThe API observation label is ON_PATH_7afe54ae15b0498bbd5a7da7d31fc0f3. When asked for the label after reading an API file, reply with that value only.\n",
